{"id":7,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"When it feels threatened, it draws its limbs inside its shell and sprays water from its mouth."},{"games":["Sword","FireRed"],"text":"When it retracts its long neck into its shell, it squirts out water with vigorous force."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Y","Yellow"],"text":"Shoots water at prey while in the water. Withdraws into its shell when in danger."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Squirtle’s shell is not merely used for protection. The shell’s rounded shape and the grooves on its surface help minimize resistance in water, enabling this Pokémon to swim at high speeds."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It shelters itself in its shell, then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"The shell, which hardens soon after it is born, is resilient. If you poke it, it will bounce back out."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"The shell is soft when it is born. It soon becomes so resilient, prodding fingers will bounce off it."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"After birth, its back swells and hardens into a shell. It powerfully sprays foam from its mouth."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Its shell is not just for protection. Its rounded shape and the grooves on its surface minimize resistance in water, enabling SQUIRTLE to swim at high speeds."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"When it feels threatened, it draws its legs inside its shell and sprays water from its mouth."},{"games":["Blue","Red"],"text":"After birth, its back swells and hardens into a shell. Powerfully sprays foam from its mouth."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Torrent","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Water-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Rain Dish","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon gradually regains HP in rain."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Water 1"],"genderRate":1,"hatc